{"id": 7398, "date": "2026-08-26T12:27:00", "date_gmt": "2026-08-26T12:27:00", "guid": {"rendered": "https://artibits.com/?p=7398", "raw": "https://artibits.com/?p=7398"}, "modified": "2026-09-17T12:37:46", "modified_gmt": "2026-09-17T12:37:46", "password": "", "slug": "pid-digitization-for-engineering-deliverable-generation", "status": "publish", "type": "post", "link": "https://artibits.com/2026/08/26/pid-digitization-for-engineering-deliverable-generation/", "title": {"raw": "P&amp;ID Digitization for Engineering Deliverable Generation", "rendered": "P&amp;ID Digitization for Engineering Deliverable Generation"}, "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong>How Artisan Transformed P&amp;IDs into a Reusable Engineering Source of Truth</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">An Oil and Gas engineering organization used Artisan to transform information contained within P&amp;IDs into structured, reusable engineering data creating a foundation for automated downstream deliverable generation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>Project Overview</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Industry:</strong> Oil and Gas Engineering</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Solution:</strong> Artisan - P&amp;ID Digitization and Engineering Deliverable Automation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Application:</strong> Engineering Data Extraction and Deliverable Generation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Integration:</strong> Existing Engineering Workflows and Project Templates</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>The Challenge</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Engineering and fabrication deliverables depended heavily on information contained within P&amp;IDs. Although these drawings contained essential data, the information was not structured for systematic reuse.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Key Challenges</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Repeated manual interpretation of P&amp;IDs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Time-intensive engineering-data extraction</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Manual compilation and cross-referencing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reuse of the same data across multiple deliverables</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>No structured source of truth connecting drawings and downstream outputs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Significant engineering effort spent on repetitive activities</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>Before Artisan</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>P&amp;IDs \u2192 Manual Interpretation \u2192 Data Extraction \u2192 Cross-Referencing \u2192 Deliverable Preparation</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">The same foundational information had to be repeatedly extracted, interpreted and compiled for different engineering and fabrication deliverables.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>The Solution</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Drishya AI deployed Artisan to interpret P&amp;IDs and convert the extracted information into structured engineering data. The solution combined machine learning and software automation with the client\u2019s Oil and Gas engineering workflow knowledge.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>The Solution Included</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">AI-assisted P&amp;ID interpretation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Automated extraction of engineering information</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Structured engineering-data modelling</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Creation of a contextual engineering database</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Integration with existing project templates</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Alignment with established engineering processes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Support for automated downstream deliverable generation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">A foundation for cross-referencing additional engineering information</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>How Artisan Works</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>P&amp;IDs \u2192 AI Interpretation \u2192 Engineering Data Model \u2192 Project Templates \u2192 Engineering Deliverables</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Artisan interprets information contained within P&amp;IDs and organizes it into a contextual engineering data model. This structured data is connected with approved project templates to support downstream deliverable generation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>\n.before-after-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n}\n\n.before-after-table td {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n    color: #333;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th:first-child {\n    width: 50%;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th:last-child {\n    width: 50%;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .before-after-table th {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        padding: 14px 12px;\n    }\n\n    .before-after-table td {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        padding: 13px 12px;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n\n<table class=\"before-after-table\">\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th>Before</th>\n            <th>After</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Static P&amp;IDs</td>\n            <td>Reusable engineering data</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual data extraction</td>\n            <td>AI-assisted interpretation</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Repeated data entry</td>\n            <td>Structured information reuse</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Disconnected information</td>\n            <td>Contextual engineering database</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual cross-referencing</td>\n            <td>Connected engineering information</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Individual document preparation</td>\n            <td>Template-based generation</td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Business Impact</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>A Reusable Engineering Source of Truth</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>P&amp;IDs \u2192 Structured Engineering Data \u2192 Downstream Deliverables</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Artisan created a connected information flow between foundational drawings, structured engineering data and downstream outputs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Engineering information could be captured once, organized systematically and reused across multiple workflows, deliverables and future projects.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>The Results</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Established a reusable engineering source of truth based on P&amp;ID data</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Enabled deliverable generation for facility modules and well sites</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Integrated automated generation into existing engineering workflows</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Connected structured data with approved project templates</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Reduced repetitive interpretation, compilation and cross-referencing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Created a foundation for connecting additional engineering information</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Converted project information into a reusable digital engineering asset</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Established a scalable foundation for future engineering and construction projects</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>Key Takeaway</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Artisan transformed P&amp;IDs from static drawings into a structured, reusable engineering source of truth creating the foundation for automated downstream deliverable generation across projects.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->", "rendered": "\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-72 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>How Artisan Transformed P&amp;IDs into a Reusable Engineering Source of Truth</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-73 wp-block-paragraph\">An Oil and Gas engineering organization used Artisan to transform information contained within P&amp;IDs into structured, reusable engineering data creating a foundation for automated downstream deliverable generation.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-74 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>Project Overview</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-75 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Industry:</strong> Oil and Gas Engineering</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-76 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Solution:</strong> Artisan &#8211; P&amp;ID Digitization and Engineering Deliverable Automation</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-77 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Application:</strong> Engineering Data Extraction and Deliverable Generation</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-78 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Integration:</strong> Existing Engineering Workflows and Project Templates</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-79 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>The Challenge</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-80 wp-block-paragraph\">Engineering and fabrication deliverables depended heavily on information contained within P&amp;IDs. Although these drawings contained essential data, the information was not structured for systematic reuse.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-81 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Key Challenges</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-82\">\n<li>Repeated manual interpretation of P&amp;IDs</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Time-intensive engineering-data extraction</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Manual compilation and cross-referencing</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Reuse of the same data across multiple deliverables</li>\n\n\n\n<li>No structured source of truth connecting drawings and downstream outputs</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Significant engineering effort spent on repetitive activities</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-83 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>Before Artisan</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-84 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>P&amp;IDs \u2192 Manual Interpretation \u2192 Data Extraction \u2192 Cross-Referencing \u2192 Deliverable Preparation</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-85 wp-block-paragraph\">The same foundational information had to be repeatedly extracted, interpreted and compiled for different engineering and fabrication deliverables.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-86 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>The Solution</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-87 wp-block-paragraph\">Drishya AI deployed Artisan to interpret P&amp;IDs and convert the extracted information into structured engineering data. The solution combined machine learning and software automation with the client\u2019s Oil and Gas engineering workflow knowledge.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-88 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>The Solution Included</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-89\">AI-assisted P&amp;ID interpretation</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-90\">Automated extraction of engineering information</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-91\">Structured engineering-data modelling</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-92\">Creation of a contextual engineering database</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-93\">Integration with existing project templates</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-94\">Alignment with established engineering processes</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-95\">Support for automated downstream deliverable generation</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-96\">A foundation for cross-referencing additional engineering information</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-97 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>How Artisan Works</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-98 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>P&amp;IDs \u2192 AI Interpretation \u2192 Engineering Data Model \u2192 Project Templates \u2192 Engineering Deliverables</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-99 wp-block-paragraph\">Artisan interprets information contained within P&amp;IDs and organizes it into a contextual engineering data model. This structured data is connected with approved project templates to support downstream deliverable generation.</p>\n\n\n\n<style>\n.before-after-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n}\n\n.before-after-table td {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n    color: #333;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th:first-child {\n    width: 50%;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th:last-child {\n    width: 50%;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .before-after-table th {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        padding: 14px 12px;\n    }\n\n    .before-after-table td {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        padding: 13px 12px;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n\n<table class=\"before-after-table\">\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th>Before</th>\n            <th>After</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Static P&amp;IDs</td>\n            <td>Reusable engineering data</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual data extraction</td>\n            <td>AI-assisted interpretation</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Repeated data entry</td>\n            <td>Structured information reuse</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Disconnected information</td>\n            <td>Contextual engineering database</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual cross-referencing</td>\n            <td>Connected engineering information</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Individual document preparation</td>\n            <td>Template-based generation</td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-100 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Business Impact</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-101 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>A Reusable Engineering Source of Truth</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-102 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>P&amp;IDs \u2192 Structured Engineering Data \u2192 Downstream Deliverables</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-103 wp-block-paragraph\">Artisan created a connected information flow between foundational drawings, structured engineering data and downstream outputs.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-104 wp-block-paragraph\">Engineering information could be captured once, organized systematically and reused across multiple workflows, deliverables and future projects.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-105 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>The Results</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-106\">Established a reusable engineering source of truth based on P&amp;ID data</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-107\">Enabled deliverable generation for facility modules and well sites</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-108\">Integrated automated generation into existing engineering workflows</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-109\">Connected structured data with approved project templates</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-110\">Reduced repetitive interpretation, compilation and cross-referencing</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-111\">Created a foundation for connecting additional engineering information</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-112\">Converted project information into a reusable digital engineering asset</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-113\">Established a scalable foundation for future engineering and construction projects</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-114 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>Key Takeaway</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-115 wp-block-paragraph\">Artisan transformed P&amp;IDs from static drawings into a structured, reusable engineering source of truth creating the foundation for automated downstream deliverable generation across projects.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n", "protected": false, "block_version": 1}, "excerpt": {"raw": "", "rendered": "<p>How Artisan Transformed P&amp;IDs into a Reusable Engineering Source of Truth An Oil and Gas engineering organization used Artisan to transform information contained within P&amp;IDs into structured, reusable engineering data creating a foundation for automated downstream deliverable generation. Project Overview Industry: Oil and Gas Engineering Solution: Artisan &#8211; P&amp;ID Digitization and Engineering Deliverable Automation Application: [&hellip;]</p>\n", "protected": false}, "author": 1, "featured_media": 7400, "comment_status": 